  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1306.03 Engineering Plans and Specifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1306.03 Engineering Plans and Specifications.\n\n(a) The applicant shall prepare and submit engineering plans and specifications that conform to the applicable design standards specified in Env-Dw 400, if applicable.\n\n(b) Department approval of the plans and specifications shall not relieve the applicant of any liabilities or responsibilities with respect to the design, construction, operation, or performance of the project.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1300.html"
